From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DeepSeek Harness <noreply@deepseek.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:17:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): add typing heatmap, statistics and refreshed home
 layout

- Record committed characters and corrections in the IME and persist
  per-day aggregates in a tiny Room database (counts only, never text).
- Put a GitHub-style 53-week heatmap card at the top of the home page,
  with total characters, accuracy, current streak and tappable days.
- Add a Statistics & heatmap screen: overview, last 7 days, accuracy and
  error rate, tracking switch, reset, five palettes and a custom color
  picker with live shade preview.
- Rebuild the settings home into four sections with icon rows, concise
  summaries and section headers.
- Cover the counting/streak/level math and palette ramps with JVM tests.

Built as 0.1.3-patchwork (versionCode 11206, arm64-v8a).
